TI  - Enhancing worker monitoring and management on large-scale construction sites with UAVs and digital twin modeling
T2  - AUTOMATION IN CONSTRUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV)
KW  - Digital twin (DT)
