TI  - The Research on the Construction Method of a Slope Digital Twin Model Driven by Surrogate Models
T2  - STRUCTURAL CONTROL & HEALTH MONITORING
LA  - English
KW  - DIC analysis
KW  - digital twins
KW  - slope safety monitoring
KW  - stacking integrated learning
