TI  - Autonomous dimensional inspection and issue tracking of rebar using semantically enriched 3D models
T2  - AUTOMATION IN CONSTRUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Autonomous
KW  - Rebar inspection
KW  - Dimensional quality control
KW  - Digital twin
KW  - Deep learning
